        {
          "id": 3155190023,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@geraldcombs - Is this currently used by UNIX-like OSes to support simultaneous installation of Wireshark and Stratoshark?  Do I need to wrap these changes in \"#ifdef OS\"-like code because Windows and MacOS have separate installers for the two applications (and don't want the subdirectory)?",
