        {
          "id": 3155680840,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "We use the \"install\" target for the Arch package (which should be an OS-native AUR package instead of a tarball) and to install tshark for fuzz testing. I'm not sure where else it's used.\n\nWe don't use it for Windows or macOS packaging.",
